.\" -*- coding: UTF-8 -*-
.TH SEGLCDD 1 "2026-11-20" "seglcd" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
seglcdd \- service feeding sensor values to the Thermaltake segment LCD, with D-Bus interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B seglcdd
.RB [ \-\-system ]
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR path ]
.br
.B systemctl \-\-user
.RB { start | stop | reload | status }
.B seglcdd
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B seglcdd
reads CPU and GPU sensors (hwmon, RAPL, NVIDIA NVML, DRM, procfs) every
.I sample_interval_ms
and sends them to the segment LCD of the Thermaltake LB360-S ARGB Sync every
.I update_interval_ms
(the display turns off after about 400\(en500 ms without a packet).
It reconnects automatically when the device appears again and sends the off packet when stopped.
.PP
It runs as a systemd user service
.RI ( Type=notify ),
needs no root privileges (the udev rule grants access with
.IR uaccess )
and offers a D-Bus interface on the session bus.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-system
Run as system service (used by the RPM/DEB/AUR packages): system bus instead of session bus and
.I /etc/seglcd/config.toml
as default configuration. The packaged unit runs it as user
.BR seglcd ;
members of the group
.B seglcd
may control it via D-Bus, everybody may read.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " path"
Configuration file (default:
.IR $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/seglcd/config.toml ).
A missing file means default settings. See
.BR seglcdd.toml (5).
.SH D-BUS INTERFACE
Bus: session; name and interface
.BR io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1 ;
object
.BR /io/github/fubar_coder/SegLcd1 .
.SS Properties
.TP
.BR Enabled " (b, read/write)"
Feed the display; false sends the off packet and releases the device (e.g. for
.BR seglcd (1)).
.TP
.BR UpdateIntervalMs " (u, read/write)"
Packet interval, 50\(en400 ms.
.TP
.BR SampleIntervalMs " (u, read/write)"
Sensor interval, 100\(en10000 ms.
.TP
.BR Connected " (b), " DevicePath " (s), " Model " (s), " ConfigPath " (s)"
Connection state and paths.
.TP
.BR Sources " (a{ss})"
Field \(-> resolved sensor source (empty = none).
.TP
.BR CurrentValues " (a{sd}), " LastPacket " (ay)"
Last values and last packet; no change signal.
.PP
.B PropertiesChanged
is emitted for Enabled, the intervals, the connection properties and Sources.
Invalid values are rejected with org.freedesktop.DBus.Error.InvalidArgs.
.SS Methods
.TP
.BI SetSensor( field ", " spec ") \(-> " source
Set the source of a field (cpu_temperature, cpu_power, cpu_voltage, gpu_temperature, gpu_usage,
gpu_power, gpu_clock, fan, pump); empty spec = automatic. Not saved until SaveConfig.
.TP
.B ReloadConfig()
Re-read the configuration file; on error the old settings stay active.
.TP
.B SaveConfig()
Write the current settings to the configuration file. With
.B \-\-system
only the values that differ from
.I /etc/seglcd/config.toml
are written, to
.IR /var/lib/seglcd/config.toml .
.SH LOGGING
Messages go to the journal in English
.RB ( "journalctl \-\-user \-u seglcdd" ).
When started in a terminal, the console output is shown in the display language.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.BR LC_MESSAGES ", " LANG
Language of D-Bus error messages and terminal output.
.TP
.B DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS
Session bus; without it the D-Bus interface is disabled, the display keeps running.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/seglcd/config.toml
Configuration of the system service
.RB ( \-\-system ).
.TP
.I /var/lib/seglcd/config.toml
Settings saved via D-Bus with
.BR \-\-system ;
they override
.IR /etc/seglcd/config.toml .
Delete the file to go back to it.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/systemd/system/seglcdd.service
System unit (packages).
.TP
.I /usr/share/dbus\-1/system.d/io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1.conf
System bus policy (packages).
.TP
.I ~/.config/seglcd/config.toml
Configuration, see
.BR seglcdd.toml (5).
.TP
.I ~/.config/systemd/user/seglcdd.service
systemd unit.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/dbus\-1/services/io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1.service
D-Bus activation (starts the service on access).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
systemctl \-\-user enable \-\-now seglcdd
busctl \-\-user get\-property io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1 \e
  /io/github/fubar_coder/SegLcd1 io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1 CurrentValues
busctl \-\-user call io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1 \e
  /io/github/fubar_coder/SegLcd1 io.github.fubar_coder.SegLcd1 \e
  SetSensor ss pump it8686_31050607:fan5
.EE
